ents via new C# APIs (no dependency on JS libraries).","All running on the fastest ever .NET framework: .NET 8+. Fully leveraging CSS and JS isolation, JS object references and module exports, etc.","Modular project: each package has a \"single responsibility\", install only what you need and reduce download size."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majorimi/blazor-components/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"58f517204b3c42d0034f9c755884da70eee086c69db3a884369659d080bbba23","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:32.756Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:32.756Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Majorsoft Blazor Components is a set of UI Components and other useful Extensions for Blazor applications. All components are free and available on NuGet.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majorimi/blazor-components/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"58f517204b3c42d0034f9c755884da70eee086c69db3a884369659d080bbba23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majorimi/blazor-components/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:32.757Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-08T20:47:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majorimi/blazor-components/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:32.757Z","hash":"58f517204b3c42d0034f9c755884da70eee086c69db3a884369659d080bbba23","originalBytes":13124,"storedBytes":13124,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["components","blazor","customizable","extensions","renders","custom","html","majorsoft","app","component","github","net","browser","css","etc.","release","used","applications","element","injectable","project","canvas","content","date","enables","exposing","input","other","panel","render","services","useful","which","api","available","button","code","code.","console","data","demo","docs","drag","full","fully","google","hosted","inputtext","interop","license","live","loading","many","maps","new","notifications","one","only","out","page",